{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣姿を見ると夏！って感じがする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/24/4902983/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近台風が凄かったり\n雨がちょくちょく降ったりしてるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏！真夏！灼熱地獄！\nみたいな感じではないね〜(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は代謝が人よりも良すぎるから\n暑くないのは寧ろ嬉しいんだけど！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏をあまり感じられてないからか\n夏が終わる感じがあまりしない(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいんだか悪いんだか〜( ˙³˙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が季節の変わり目を感じるのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外で蝉ではなくて\n鈴虫が鳴いた時。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋だな〜って感じるんだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、夏服よりも秋服が着たくなったら\n夏が終わるって感じがする。( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはどう？？(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウムカラーの赤と青。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"街中でも、赤と青を見つけると\nどうしても反応してしまうのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私だけ？？(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/24/4902983/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このイヤリングも赤と青！！\n可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤と青ってパキッとしてるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッキリしてるし\n(←顔みたいにって書こうと思ったけどやめた。結局書いたけど。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメリカンだし\n(←優里に言われたの。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"混ぜると紫だし\n(←実はカラー決めた時は紫には気付かなかった。。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても好きな色！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服でも、赤い服を見つけると\nあ、いいな♡と思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青い靴を見つけると\nカッコいいな！と思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕日の赤も大好きだし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海の青も空の青も大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで突然の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/24/4902983/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤と青がテーマな写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは去年の年始に撮ったもの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今でもお気に入り。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「人との距離のはかりかた」plentyさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲を聴いてると歌詞がすぅっと\n頭の中に入ってくる。\n聞きやすいし覚えやすい。\n歌詞が真っ直ぐだからだっていうのも\nあると思うけど胸にしみる。\n声も好き！\n優しくて儚い。素敵。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、ふと隣を見たらこれが置いてあった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/24/4902983/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋のノート。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かに盗まれると思ったのかな。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰も盗まないよヽ(；；)丿笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ある意味)平和な毎日です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}